Package: dgeecr
Title: Access to Portuguese Education Statistics by Region (DGEEC)
Version: 0.1.4
Authors@R:
    person("João Dionísio", email = "joaodrdionisio@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Client for the education statistics portal of the
    Directorate-General for Education and Science Statistics (DGEEC) of
    Portugal, <https://estatisticas-educacao.dgeec.medu.pt/regioesemnumeros/>.
    Each page of the portal is a form whose cartesian product of options is
    traversed with parallel 'httr2' requests, and the returned HTML is
    converted into a long table (one row per observation), covering students
    enrolled by school year, region, school level, nature (public or private),
    gender and age group, together with establishment, indicator and
    human-resource tables. Results can be enriched with Portuguese
    administrative and health divisions (ULS, NUTS and the 2024 health
    regions) using a linkage file bundled with the package, and requested by
    name as well as by internal code. Downloaded pages are cached on disk, so
    that interrupted extractions can be resumed.
